Subject: Resolve Maven home through directory symlinks

On merged-usr systems, /bin can point to /usr/bin. Resolve directory
symlinks before processing parent components in the install path so
relative launcher links work through both entry points.

Upstream-Status: Not submitted

SPDX-FileCopyrightText: (C) 2026 openRuyi Project Contributors
SPDX-License-Identifier: MulanPSL-2.0

--- a/apache-maven/src/bin/mvn
+++ b/apache-maven/src/bin/mvn
@@ -116,5 +116,5 @@

 # make it fully qualified
-MAVEN_HOME=`cd "$MAVEN_HOME" && pwd`
+MAVEN_HOME=`cd -P "$MAVEN_HOME" && pwd -P`

 cd "$saveddir"
